---
// 首页第3屏：地区分部 —— 城市玻璃卡
---

<section aria-labelledby="branches-title" class="section branches-section" id="branches">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <p class="section-kicker reveal">Branches · 地区分部</p>
    <h2 class="section-title reveal" id="branches-title">
      你的城市，<span class="grad-text">亮灯了吗</span>
    </h2>
    <p class="section-lead reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 0.05s">
      Seeker 的分部散布在不同的城市。同一片夜空下，我们在各自的街头按下快门，
      又在同一个群里分享彼此的光。
    </p>

    <div class="branch-grid">
      <div class="glass-card branch-card reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 0.1s">
        <div class="branch-badge">广佛</div>
        <h3 class="branch-name">广佛分部</h3>
        <p class="branch-desc">
          广州 &amp; 佛山。老城的骑楼、珠江的夜色、顺德的烟火气，
          都是广佛追光者镜头里的常客。
        </p>
        <div class="card-tags">
          <span>城市漫游</span>
          <span>夜景</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="glass-card branch-card reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 0.18s">
        <div class="branch-badge">金陵</div>
        <h3 class="branch-name">金陵分部</h3>
        <p class="branch-desc">
          南京。梧桐树影、明城墙与玄武湖的晨雾，金陵分部偏爱有故事的光。
        </p>
        <div class="card-tags">
          <span>人文</span>
          <span>扫街</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="branch-card branch-card--more reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 0.26s">
        <div class="branch-badge branch-badge--more">?</div>
        <h3 class="branch-name">更多分部</h3>
        <p class="branch-desc">你的城市还没有据点？联系主理人，成为第一个点亮它的人。</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <a class="mini-cta reveal" href="#join">想加入你所在的城市 →</a>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .branches-section {
    background:
      radial-gradient(55% 40% at 85% 15%, oklch(0.7 0.16 25 / 0.07), transparent 70%),
      #000;
  }

  .branch-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .branch-card {
    padding: 28px 24px;
    cursor: default;
  }

  /* 「更多分部」卡：虚线边框留白卡，区别于实卡 */
  .branch-card--more {
    background: transparent;
    border: 1.5px dashed oklch(1 0 0 / 0.22);
    border-radius: 16px;
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: none;
    backdrop-filter: none;
    transition:
      transform 0.3s ease,
      border-color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .branch-card--more:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    border-color: oklch(0.75 0.12 185 / 0.5);
  }

  .branch-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: #000;
    background: linear-gradient(45deg, #4ecdc4, #ff6b6b);
    padding: 3px 12px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .branch-badge--more {
    background: oklch(1 0 0 / 0.12);
    color: oklch(0.85 0 0);
  }

  .branch-name {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #fff;
    margin: 0 0 8px;
  }

  .branch-desc {
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: oklch(0.75 0 0);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .card-tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 6px;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }

  .card-tags span {
    font-size: 11px;
    padding: 3px 10px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    border: 1px solid oklch(1 0 0 / 0.15);
    color: oklch(0.78 0 0);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .branch-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .branch-card {
      padding: 22px 20px;
    }
  }
</style>
